&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an MLX Metal bug that could reduce output quality for NVFP4 models, particularly Laguna.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.32.4...v0.32.5&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.32.4...v0.32.5&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;vLLM v0.26.0 Release Notes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release features 411 commits from 212 contributors (61 new)!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Inkling model family&lt;/strong&gt; with a full support stack: base modeling (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4898170598&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48799&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48799/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48799&quot;&gt;#48799&lt;/a&gt;), piecewise CUDA graph support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4899688891&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48822&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48822/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48822&quot;&gt;#48822&lt;/a&gt;), Hopper FA4 relative attention (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4904341054&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48858&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48858/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48858&quot;&gt;#48858&lt;/a&gt;), MTP=1 speculative decoding (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4904726678&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48869&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48869/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48869&quot;&gt;#48869&lt;/a&gt;), LoRA (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4906043266&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48884&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48884/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48884&quot;&gt;#48884&lt;/a&gt;), and standard ModelOpt NVFP4 quantization (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4915144372&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48990&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48990/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48990&quot;&gt;#48990&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek-V4 performance push&lt;/strong&gt; across vendors: a specialized routing kernel (2.94% E2E TPOT, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4887407554&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48660&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48660/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48660&quot;&gt;#48660&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;code&gt;fused_topk_bias&lt;/code&gt; (1.5–2x kernel, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4797185825&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47463&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47463/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47463&quot;&gt;#47463&lt;/a&gt;), and redundant repeat/copy removal (1.8% E2E TPOT, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4847786234&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48137&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48137/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48137&quot;&gt;#48137&lt;/a&gt;), plus ROCm two-stage compressor for HCA prefill (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4817723742&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47718&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47718/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47718&quot;&gt;#47718&lt;/a&gt;), sparse decode/prefill optimizations (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4876359832&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48519&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48519/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48519&quot;&gt;#48519&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4896417093&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48788&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48788/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48788&quot;&gt;#48788&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4709739589&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46275&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46275/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46275&quot;&gt;#46275&lt;/a&gt;), and DSpark speculative decoding on AMD (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4793204497&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47419&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47419/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47419&quot;&gt;#47419&lt;/a&gt;) and XPU (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4815455307&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47677&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47677/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47677&quot;&gt;#47677&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
